  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Finding the number of hybridized orbitals (by using the formula) in the central atom to find the hybridization:<br /><br /><math><mrow><mtext>H</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>V</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>M</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>C</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>A</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>SbCl</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> <math> <mrow> <msubsup> <mtext></mtext></msubsup></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>SnCl</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/19